# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows checks files out as CRLF while the
# index and every other platform use LF. Biome then reports the whole file as a
# formatting error, which is why the frontend appeared to have ~157 format
# violations that were really just line-ending churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must stay byte-exact.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary

# Lockfiles: keep LF so diffs stay reviewable.
package-lock.json -text
